cm kho b\u00e1u,\` ch\u1ecb Ng\u00e2n n\u00f3i. \`C\u00f3 hai \u0111\u1ed9i. T\u00edn, em d\u1eabn m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ed9i. Ng\u1ecdc, em d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ed9i kia.\` Bin, em h\u1ecd c\u1ee7a Ng\u1ecdc, ch\u1ea1y ngay v\u1ec1 \u0111\u1ed9i ch\u1ecb m\u00ecnh.`},{`en`:`\`[[But]] [[first]], [[a]] [[practice]] [[game]] [[in]] [[this]] [[room]],\` [[says|say]] Ngan. \`[[There]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[small]] [[box]] [[here]]. [[Listen]] [[and]] [[go]]. [[Turn]] [[left]]. [[Walk]] [[to]] [[the]] [[window]]. [[Now]] [[look]] [[up]]!\``,`vn`:`\`Nh\u01b0ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc ti\u00ean, m\u00ecnh ch\u01a1i th\u1eed trong ph\u00f2ng n\u00e0y \u0111\u00e3,\` ch\u1ecb Ng\u00e2n n\u00f3i. \`\u1ede \u0111\u00e2y c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc h\u1ed9p nh\u1ecf. Nghe r\u1ed3i \u0111i nh\u00e9. R\u1ebd tr\u00e1i. \u0110i t\u1edbi c\u1eeda s\u1ed5. Gi\u1edd th\u00ec nh\u00ecn l\u00ean!\``},{`en`:`[[Above]] [[the]] [[window]], [[there]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[paper]] [[star]]. [[On]] [[it]], [[it]] [[says|say]], \`[[Look]] [[under]] [[the]] [[big]] [[table]].\` [[Under]] [[the]] [[table]], [[there]] [[is|be]] [[another]] [[piece]] [[of]] [[paper]]: \`[[Go]] [[behind]] [[the]] [[door]].\` [[Behind]] [[the]] [[door]], [[there]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[third]] [[piece]] [[of]] [[paper]]. [[It]] [[says|say]], \`[[The]] [[box]] [[is|be]] [[between]] [[two]] [[chairs|chair]], [[in]] [[front]] [[of]] [[the]] [[clock]].\``,`vn`:`Ph\u00eda tr\u00ean c\u1eeda s\u1ed5 c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t ng\u00f4i sao b\u1eb1ng gi\u1ea5y. Tr\u00ean \u0111\u00f3 ghi: \`Nh\u00ecn xu\u1ed1ng g\u1ea7m c\u00e1i b\u00e0n to.\` D\u01b0\u1edbi g\u1ea7m b\u00e0n c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t t\u1edd gi\u1ea5y kh\u00e1c: \`Ra sau c\u00e1nh c\u1eeda.\` Sau c\u00e1nh c\u1eeda l\u1ea1i c\u00f3 t\u1edd gi\u1ea5y th\u1ee9 ba. Tr\u00ean \u0111\u00f3 ghi: \`Chi\u1ebfc h\u1ed9p n\u1eb1m gi\u1eefa hai c\u00e1i gh\u1ebf, ngay tr\u01b0\u1edbc chi\u1ebfc \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u1ed3.\``},{`en`:`[[The]] [[children|child]] [[run]] [[here]] [[and]] [[there]], [[up]] [[and]] [[down]]. Bin [[turns|turn]] [[right]] [[when]] [[everybody]] [[turns|turn]] [[left]]. [[He]] [[walks|walk]] [[into]] [[the]] [[door]]. \`[[I]] [[am|be]] okay!\` [[he]] [[says|say]] [[from]] [[the]] [[floor]].`,`vn`:`L\u0169 tr\u1ebb ch\u1ea1y t\u1edbi ch\u1ea1y lui, ch\u1ea1y l\u00ean ch\u1ea1y xu\u1ed1ng. C\u1ea3 b\u1ecdn r\u1ebd tr\u00e1i th\u00ec Bin l\u1ea1i r\u1ebd ph\u1ea3i. C\u1eadu \u0111\u00e2m s\u1ea7m v\u00e0o c\u00e1nh c\u1eeda. \`Em kh\u00f4ng sao!\` c\u1eadu n\u00f3i, ng\u01b0\u1eddi v\u1eabn n\u1eb1m d\u01b0\u1edbi s\u00e0n.`},{`en`:`Tin [[finds|find]] [[the]] [[box]] [[first]]. [[It]] [[is|be]] [[on]] [[the]] [[floor]], [[next to]] [[the]] [[clock]]. [[In]] [[it]], [[there]] [[are|be]] [[twenty]] [[small]] [[chocolates|chocolate]]. Tin [[eats|eat]] [[one]], [[and]] [[then]] [[another]] [[one]]. \`Tin!\` [[says|say]] Ngoc. \`[[They]] [[are|be]] [[for]] [[everybody]]!\` Tin [[smiles|smile]]. \`[[Anything]] [[else]] [[in]] [[the]] [[box]]?\``,`vn`:`T\u00edn t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y chi\u1ebfc h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean. N\u00f3 n\u1eb1m tr\u00ean s\u00e0n, ngay c\u1ea1nh chi\u1ebfc \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u1ed3. Trong h\u1ed9p c\u00f3 hai m\u01b0\u01a1i vi\u00ean s\u00f4-c\u00f4-la nh\u1ecf. T\u00edn \u0103n m\u1ed9t vi\u00ean, r\u1ed3i th\u00eam m\u1ed9t vi\u00ean n\u1eefa. \`T\u00edn!\` Ng\u1ecdc k\u00eau l\u00ean. \`C\u1ee7a c\u1ea3 b\u1ecdn \u0111\u1ea5y!\` T\u00edn c\u01b0\u1eddi toe. \`Trong h\u1ed9p c\u00f2n g\u00ec n\u1eefa kh\u00f4ng?\``},{`en`:`Ngan [[laughs|laugh]]. \`[[Good]]. [[Now]] [[you]] [[know]] [[left]] [[and]] [[right]]. [[Next]], [[we]] [[go]] [[out]] [[on]] [[the]] [[street]]. [[But]] [[who]] [[has|have]] [[a]] [[map]]?\` [[At]] [[the]] [[back]] [[of]] [[the]] [[room]], [[a]] [[quiet]] [[boy]] [[puts|put]] [[his]] [[hand]] [[up]].`,`vn`:`Ch\u1ecb Ng\u00e2n b\u1eadt c\u01b0\u1eddi. \`T\u1ed1t l\u1eafm. Gi\u1edd c\u00e1c em \u0111\u00e3 bi\u1ebft tr\u00e1i ph\u1ea3i r\u1ed3i. Ti\u1ebfp theo, m\u00ecnh ra ph\u1ed1. Nh\u01b0ng ai c\u00f3 b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ed3 n\u00e0o?\` \u1ede cu\u1ed1i ph\u00f2ng, m\u1ed9t c\u1eadu b\u00e9 \u00edt n\u00f3i gi\u01a1 tay.`}],`tease`:`C\u1eadu b\u00e9 c\u00f3 t\u1ea5m b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ed3 l\u00e0 ai?`}]}